																								<r3d:remarks>At present, there are twenty-two Members distributed around the globe; http://www.spaceweather.org/ISES/rwc/rwc.html
ISES is Network Member of ISC-WDS.
Prior to 1996, ISES was called the International URSIgram and World Days Service (IUWDS). The IUWDS was formed in 1962 as a combination of the former International World Days Service, initiated in 1959 as part of the International Geophysical Year (IGY), and the former URSI Central Committee of USRIgrams, which initiated rapid international data interchange services in 1928.</r3d:remarks>
